<HelloFraandsPage title="Data deletion" summary="Account aur apni jaankari hatane ka anurodh kar sakte hain." review={false} related={[]}>
<h2>Request deletion</h2>
<p>Use the account-deletion option in your dashboard, or email {'{{CONTACT_EMAIL}}'} from your registered email address. Include your registered phone number if needed to find the account. We verify that the request is yours. Never send an OTP, Aadhaar number, or document image by email.</p>
<h2>What is removed</h2>
<p>When deletion is confirmed and processed, account access is closed and your public profile is removed immediately. Personal account details that are no longer needed are deleted. Any eligible unused-balance refund follows the <a href="/refunds">refund policy</a>.</p>
<h2>What must be kept</h2>
<p>Call metadata is retained for 180 days from the call. Audio is retained for {'{{AUDIO_RETENTION_DAYS}}'} days. Transaction records are kept for the period required by tax law. We may preserve relevant records for a legal request or unresolved dispute. Retained records have restricted access and are not used to keep your profile active.</p>
<h2>Confirmation</h2>
<p>We email you after verifying the request and confirm when deletion is complete. That reply will explain the expected completion date and any records we must retain. If you have not received a response, contact the <a href="/grievance">grievance officer</a>, whose process provides acknowledgement within 24 hours and resolution within 15 days.</p>
</HelloFraandsPage>
